[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://vehicles/vehicle_tune.gd" id="1_tune"]

; The scooter, the fixer's vehicle (P1-021): two wheels on the centre line (front steers, rear drives) with the hidden
; stabiliser (a roll spring and damper keeps the physics body upright) and a visual lean of the drawn body into turns;
; the stand-in kit scooter with a rider. GAME.md "Movement and camera feel": top speed about 90 km/h, 0 to 60 km/h in
; 5 to 6 s, 80 to 0 in 25 to 32 m. Gears stand in for the CVT (a short shift pause). Mass with the rider.
